      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We had signed our contract with Solar Engineering in November 2018 with the promise that the procedure would be done in the next couple of months. After 6 months of silence, I had tried to contact them numerous times only to be sent straight to voice mail. Only after sending a text advising them to give us a refund did they tried reaching us. They would promise to do the installation week after week but never show up on the day promised. At this rate, we could no longer trust this company and was adamant about or refund. The person I spoke with said he will transfer the refund straight into our account; that was in June. Everytime I call to check up on the process, he would come up with excuses.Please do not even consider working with these people. They are unprofessional and untrustworthy. We did not do proper research and that's on us. I'm sure there are better solar panels installers out there.",
      "value_for_money_rating": 1.0,
